<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">TITƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Titɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Titɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan wà Pɔl kàsön akà Titɔ awà kàsälà anà nde. Un'kaan awà anà in'kaan wàtàtwɛb anà wàywɛɛl kàsɔn Pɔl akà Tumàtɛ bàfàbel naa « in'kaan a aseey ».</para>
  <para style="ip">Uboo in'kaan ami, Pɔl akapaa an'lwɛŋ akà Titɔ asànaa kàpɛ nde akà Tumàtɛ naa nde aler aben Ikɔ̈ɔ̈ŋ a aklistɔ abyà u nsɛmà. Aŋuyɛnà bàfàkyey naa un'kaan akà Titɔ bàsön ungö a ntoo a Pɔl u bɔlokà u mbalà yàyweel kisii a 64 - 65 ungö a mböör a Yɛsu. Titɔ kàkal un'ngɛlɛki, waa kàbulà un'klistɔ. Pɔl kun'syen u Yɛlusàlɛm ntɔn mukàbwey anà andweer a Ikööŋ kwo. Wɛɛ Andweer a Ikööŋ bamwɛy bàkweenà naa bàkyɛy aklistɔ mpa abà Ayudà ntɔn muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ungö a mbaaŋ, andweer bàpɛ Pɔl ibaal musal uboo a baar mpa abà Ayudà mukɔɔn alab un'kɔɔn awà. Abun sye, Titɔ bun'kyɛy anki. Pɔl kàsun'wɛy u Krɛt ntɔn musɔɔl anà musà andwer kan'bul manswà kwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl kun'swaŋà naa ba bàkal anà indweer anà bàlab an'lɔɔŋ a ndandaa. Wɛy ba bàkɔɔn akal baar a man'be, wɛɛ baar a nkääl aŋàbwaŋ, bàyöb ndandaa. Mbuur ukwo anki muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a nsyääl ande, wɛɛ u mbwo a làkwikilà ande amu Yɛsu Klistɔ mpɛl. Ntɔn làkwikilà làfàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ aŋàpɔŋà anà inzaam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Unsà un'lwaaŋ ndaa ayà uboo a un'kaan awà ayi: - 1.1-4: Mbɔr - 1.5-16: An'yiilà a Ikööŋ a Krɛt anà ità a nsyeel a mbaaŋ - 2.1-15: Nswɛɛŋ ntɔn itsuŋ a ifà ifà anà isin a ya - 3.1-11: Ukyer yàŋàbwaŋ anà isin a ya - 3.12-15: Mbɔr a ntsüü.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Mɛ Pɔl, un'syääl a Nzam anà ntööm a Klistɔ Yɛsu ntɔn musyen baar kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l Nzam unsà làkwikilà anà unsà un'yɛnà a ndandaa asànaa inzaam ilɔɔmà kya, <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>unsà làkyän a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye kàpɛ Nzam ilää, Nzam awà mpa afàtà loor. Nde kya kapɛ kusà a an'taaŋ a mbul a in'tye, <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>anà u taaŋ kàsi nde, nde kàswɛŋ Ndaa ande uboo a an'lɔɔŋ amà ban'pɛ mulab nswɛɛŋ a Nzam awà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi.<verse eid="TIT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>Akà Titɔ, mwan amɛ wà ndandaa unsà làkwikilà abi là un'tüüb: Wɛy Taaràbi Nzam anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi Klistↄ Yɛsu bapɛ kab a ngway anà duu.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isal a Titɔ u Krɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Isàkal naa mɛ kàsawɛy u Krɛt, yà ntɔn naa ngye asàmay an'yilà màsääl anà musà andweer a Ikööŋ u bul lanswà mulab nswɛɛŋ kapɛ mɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/>Undweer akal mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n ube, un'dim a un'kyay mwɛy mpɛl, akal anà baan aŋàlàkwikilà mpa ban'kwo mukafüün naa ba bye anà nkääl ambe anà aŋunkwɛm. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Ntɔn un'kyɛɛŋ a Ikööŋ akal mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n ube, ntɔn nde wà un'leer a isal a Nzam: nde ukal anki mbuur afàböön baar ndaa, ŋankyɛl, un'yöör a man, ŋangwiy, mbuur afàleŋ bweel a nswɛn, <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>wɛɛ nde akal ŋun'kaay, un'sam a ndaa aŋàbwaŋ, ŋan'kyän aŋàbwaŋ, mbuur a balàbal, ŋun'kyɛɛl, ŋankääŋ a mpem, <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/>wàŋàbääb a Ndaa asànaa bàlɔŋ ya, ntɔn nde ukwe mulɛɛl unsà an'lɔɔŋ a ndandaa anà mutɔn asyeel a mbaaŋ.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Ntɔn baar mbɔɔn baŋun'tswe ngwal, anà ŋàloor, sin sin uboo a Ayudà aŋàlàkwikilà. <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>Ngye akyer atsum mun. Ba bàmutwaal lingyoomà uboo a an'ywar aŋikiinà, muyilɔɔŋ indiir mpa byan'kwo mulɔŋ, ntɔn muwal bweel a nswɛn. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12"/>Umwɛy uboo a ba, ŋangɔɔm aba ŋakwo, kàtɛn naa: « Taaŋ lanswà Bàkrɛt bà ŋaloor, nstür a mpɔr, abwal bàfàkwen nà udyà mpɛl. » <verse eid="TIT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13"/>Aki imbäl a ndandaa. Lalan, aŋän a ngwal, ntɔn ba bàkäl anà làkwikilà a ndandaa <verse eid="TIT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>anà ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n alab in'sim a Ayudà anà nswɛɛŋ a baar ifàpà ndandaa ngö. <verse eid="TIT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>Indiir byanswà byàŋàpɔŋà akà baar abaŋàpɔŋà. Wɛɛ akà baar mpa bàŋàpɔŋà anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà, undiir mwɛy wàŋàpoŋà watɛy, ntɔn un'yɛnà anà an'kyän aba màŋàtay. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>Ba bàfàkyey naa ba bàkyun'yöb Nzam, wɛɛ ba bàkyun'tɔn u nsyääl aba. Ba bà baar a ŋingyääy, bun'tswe ngwal anà bàkwe anki akikikye mukyer undiir aŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a balàbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Wɛɛ akà ngye, lɔŋ indiir byàfàlab an'lɔɔŋ a balàbal. <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Wɛy anün abaal bàkäl baar a nkwaam, bàlàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, bàŋàtɔɔl mpem, baar a ndandaa unsà làkwikilà aba, unsà ukwen anà unsà nkääŋ a mpem. <verse eid="TIT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Ifà imwɛy sye, wɛy andweer akaar bàkäl asànaa baar inkyɛɛl: bàkɔɔn akal aŋatwee anà anweel a man. Wɛy ba bàlɔŋ ndaa aŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>ntɔn ba bàlwɛŋ asye mukwen adim aba anà baan aba, <verse eid="TIT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>bàkäl baar a nkwaam, bàŋàpɔŋà, bàler ndwà aba ubwaŋàbwaŋ, bàkyer ubwaŋ, bàkäl anà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n akà adim aba, ntɔn mbuur ukɔɔn abɛy Ndaa a Nzam.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Alwɛŋ sye atö bàkäl anà nkwaam unsà ndaa yanswà, <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>unsà indiir byanswà. Mɛɛy ngye ŋàkwo naa ngye awà mbaan a isal a ntsà: mpööŋ a an'lɔɔŋ, ibyääl, <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>ndaa a balàbal ayà mpa ban'kwo musyeel mbaaŋ, ntɔn ukɔɔn aman undiir un'be mutɛn a bi, wɛy un'yiiŋ uwɛl un'tɛr a nswɛn.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Wɛy asɔ bàkäl anà unkyeey akà ankum aba unsà indiir byanswà, wɛy ba bapɛ un'sak anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asà mbaaŋ anà ba, <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>itàkal muyib akà undiir aba umwɛy, wɛɛ bàswɛŋ taaŋ lanswà naa ba bà bàlää, ntɔn mupà làkoo akà an'lɔɔŋ a Nzam, Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi.<verse eid="TIT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Ntɔn, kab a ngway a Nzam alà ntwà a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baar banswà làkyer amɛnà. <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>Kab a ngway a Nzam alà làfilɔŋ muwɛy nsyääl ambe anà ngyal a indiir a mɛɛn mà, ntɔn mukal u taaŋ alà unsà nkwaam, unsà balàbal anà unsà inzaam, <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>apà ikadilà bi làkyän aŋàsöönà ubwaŋ anà ilä làsàmɛnà làkoo a Nzam abi wàkölàköl anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/>Nde kàpɛ nde ŋakwo ntɔn bi, ntɔn mukitsuuŋ unsà an'kyän an'be manswà anà mupɔŋ un'sɛŋ mwɛy mukal wànde, wàŋàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ntɔn isal a ntsà. <verse eid="TIT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Tɛn indiir abi, pà an'lwɛŋ anà ŋan unsà ikɔ̈b kyànswà. Wɛy mbuur ukɔ̈ɔ̈n abɛy!<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkääl a aklistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Ayɔɔb aŋàlàkwikilà bàkäl anà unkyeey akabyääl anà akamfum a nsi, bàkyer awem, bàkal anà ukwen mukyer ndaa aŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>bàkɔɔn atwee akà mbuur mwɛy, bàtiin ngwiy, bàmɛnà aŋukanà, bàswɛŋ duu taaŋ lanswà akà baar banswà. <verse eid="TIT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Ntɔn bi sye itaan, bi kàkäl ipool, baar a un'tswe ngwal, baar aŋàdiimà mbwo, asɔ a ngyal a ifà ifà anà un'sak a ifà ifà, kàkäl uboo a kɔɔrà anà un'köl, baar a ŋingyäy u mii a baar, bi kàyiiŋà bi a bi. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Wɛɛ, umpal bàmɛnà ubwaŋ a Nzam, Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi anà ukwen ande ntɔn baar, <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>nde kitsü mɔ̈ɔ̈, kà ntɔn bi kàtàkyer isal a balàbal anki, wɛɛ ntɔn ngyɛb ande ŋakwo, u mbwo a an'dà a mböör akün anà yà Dweelà In'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Dwelà In'kyɛɛl awà, Nzam kun'pay mbɔɔn udu a bi u mbwo a Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi Yɛsu Klistɔ, <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>ntɔn nde kitwey bàbalàbal u mbwo a kab a ngway ande, unsà làkyän, bi ibulà awɛɛl a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="TIT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Ndaa ayin yà làkwikilà.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Mɛ in'kwen naa ngye asi muküünà unsà indiir abi, ntɔn baar banswà bàfàsà làkwikilà amu Nzam, bàsöönà mukyer isal a ntsà. Indiir abi byà byàntwɛn anà byàndöŋ akà baar. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Wɛɛ, tiin mbaaŋ a ipool, nsim a an'ywar, an'syee, ngwiy ntɔn un'kɔɔn, ntɔn indiir abi ndöŋ byatɛy, bya byà bunàbun. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>Mbuur afàtwaal nkaabà, un'lwom ungö a lwɛŋ atàtwɛb anà làyweel: <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>muyöb naa mbuur a tub awà wàŋàdiimà mbwo anà wun'be, nde afàpɛɛl ikwàndwà nde ŋakwo.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>Umpal in'satööm mɛ Artɛmas itàkal Tishik, kyer ngwal muyan'taan u Nikɔpɔlis. Ntɔn mɛ kàbön naa mɛ in'yàkal kwo u paŋà a mpye. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/>Sà un'kanà mupà Zɛnas awà mbak anà Apɔlɔsi indiir abà ba abyà mfun u nkyeen aba, ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n akal anà nkyääŋ a undiir. <verse eid="TIT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Bàbi ŋakwo sye bàkyer alɔŋàkà mubilà afwee unsà isal a ntsà, ntɔn mukwey ngyal a gyä, anà mukɔɔn akal abwal. <verse eid="TIT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Baar banswà abà anà mɛ bàmapà mbɔr. Apɛ asam abi aŋàkwikilà mbɔr. Wɛy kab a ngway làkäl anà bɛ banswà!<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
